mapping "V8004.1" source="V8004" target="215258004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V8004 = Swedish 5-char extension of ICD-10 V80.0 (rider/occupant injured by fall from or
        being thrown from animal/animal-drawn vehicle in noncollision accident), with 5th char SNOMED CT
        215258004 36198007 = vital activity (rest, sleep, meal, personal hygiene). Target SNOMED CT 442402
        (215258004) is the standard crosswalk target for parent V80.0 (Athena ICD10 45546945 -> 442402
        Maps to); the activity qualifier has no separate SNOMED CT concept, so parent target subsumes the
        source -> broader. : verified crosswalk via parent, but source is a Swedish 5-char
        activity-bearing extension not independently re-verified. Alt target 444074 (Victim of vehicular
        AND/OR traffic accident) is the broader victim concept also mapped from V80.0; weaker (two
        levels broader).
        """
}
